; Regression: an Error token after a complete statement on the same line also got K0102
; ("expected a line break") with a machine-applicable fix that only moved the bad character to
; its own line. The parser never adds a diagnostic for a lexer Error token (diagnostics.md);
; K0001 covers it. The token is wrapped in an ErrorNode where it occurs.
(SourceFile
  (FuncDecl func f (ParamList)
    (Block (NameExpr a) (ErrorNode $) (NameExpr b) (ErrorNode $) (NameExpr c) (ErrorNode " ")))
  (FieldDecl let d = (Literal 1))
  (ErrorNode $))
